 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.6-rc6 — OSC Lab premium redesign
+
+- Rebuilt OSC Lab around a polished live-status dashboard inspired by a dedicated desktop companion.
+- Added top-level connection health for OSC, media, world sync, Pulsoid, and chatbox broadcasting.
+- Added a premium Now Playing card with live elapsed/total time and progress.
+- Added reorderable live-status blocks with persistent priority order.
+- Replaced avatar-parameter controls with a connection-health workspace.
+- Added preset cards, a stronger live preview, character budget feedback, and a recent output log.
+- Kept low-level avatar OSC sender support available internally without exposing it in the main UI.
+
 ## 0.4.4-rc4 — Live media timeline
 
 - Added real Windows media-session position and duration to Now Playing.
